SYNTHESIS
========================================================================================================
Most useful arc criteria in this audit:
  s506_lrc_close_sector: tie_rate->close_pair_count, mean_abs_spearman=1.000, ties=0.689, scc=0.174
  additive_danger_interface: tie_rate->safe_gap_count, mean_abs_spearman=0.882, ties=0.121, scc=0.174
  product_sum_danger: tie_rate->safe_gap_count, mean_abs_spearman=0.840, ties=0.121, scc=0.174
  s506_local_moat_min: origin_score_norm->lonely_vertices, mean_abs_spearman=0.837, ties=0.491, scc=0.174
  local_two_guard: origin_score_norm->lonely_vertices, mean_abs_spearman=0.837, ties=0.491, scc=0.174
  incident_danger_sum: origin_score_norm->max_gap, mean_abs_spearman=0.815, ties=0.268, scc=0.174
  s506_phase_half: H->max_gap, mean_abs_spearman=0.798, ties=0.000, scc=0.881

Interpretation:
  1. Static x+2/x*2 labels are not time-loneliness meters by themselves.
     Their job is to name the operation-grid branch of each obstruction.
  2. Once those labels weight current pair danger, they become moving
     loneliness coordinates: dyadic, additive, multiplicative, and
     product-sum danger are all different projections of the same fiber.
  3. A000568 supplies the quotient/base analogy: complete orientations are
     classified after forgetting labels, while LRC needs the labelled
     operation-grid and endpoint-pressure fiber above that base.
  4. Addition behaves like horizontal transport among odd-core cells;
     multiplication behaves like vertical branch refinement; product-sum
     equations are the interfaces where arity/addition is traded for
     multiplicative factor structure.

Candidate loneliness-related metric vector:
  phase_H, lrc_close_tie_rate, incident_danger_origin_score,
  dyadic_danger_score_hist, additive_danger_score_hist,
  multiplicative_danger_score_hist, product_sum_danger_score_hist,
  strict pressure SCCs, endpoint-labelled origin bracket.

Conjectural next move: project hard rows to the A000568 base, but carry this
operation-weighted danger vector as fiber data; mixed fibers are repair
opportunities and all-forbidden fibers are the counterexample-shaped object.
